{
  "_comment": [
    "A span from a service that writes the Gateway's own verdict attributes itself.",
    "",
    "Nothing prevents this: an Agent stamps the resource attributes its Telemetry",
    "Contract declares and forwards everything else untouched, so whatever a service",
    "puts in the otel.guardrail. namespace arrives at the Gateway intact. If the",
    "Pipeline Guardrail only ever set those attributes on violation, this span would",
    "reach the Backend claiming otel.guardrail.blocking=false — and that is the one",
    "field an operator alerts on, so a service could opt out of enforcement by",
    "asserting compliance.",
    "",
    "It is forged at BOTH levels on purpose. Clearing only the resource would leave",
    "the span-level copy, and most Backends flatten record and resource attributes",
    "into one queryable field, so the forgery would still answer the query.",
    "",
    "The harness posts this through the COMPLIANT Agent, whose telemetry violates",
    "nothing, and then asserts no otel.guardrail attribute reaches the Backend at",
    "all. See ADR 0015."
  ],
  "resourceSpans": [
    {
      "resource": {
        "attributes": [
          {
            "key": "service.name",
            "value": { "stringValue": "harness-sample-service" }
          },
          {
            "key": "otel.guardrail.blocking",
            "value": { "boolValue": false }
          },
          {
            "key": "otel.guardrail.violation.S1",
            "value": { "stringValue": "info" }
          }
        ]
      },
      "scopeSpans": [
        {
          "scope": { "name": "otel-platform-harness" },
          "spans": [
            {
              "traceId": "__TRACE_ID__",
              "spanId": "__SPAN_ID__",
              "name": "__SPAN_NAME__",
              "kind": 2,
              "startTimeUnixNano": "__START_NANOS__",
              "endTimeUnixNano": "__END_NANOS__",
              "attributes": [
                {
                  "key": "otel.guardrail.blocking",
                  "value": { "boolValue": false }
                }
              ],
              "status": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
